WEBVTT

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.010
Presently there are hundreds of alien species living their lives on Earth.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:16.770
These children, due to the dumbass prince of the planet Dogura, have been thrown onto another planet:

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:22.300
Calvary, which has been constructed as an RPG!

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.100
Meanwhile, back on Earth...

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.080
Okay!

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.260
Everyone, take your seats!

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.380
Those kids are still absent today.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.600
If they don't come back by tomorrow, maybe I'll go search for them.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.390
And I'll make that foolish prince

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.930
take his last breath!

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:02.650
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:07.610
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.600
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:18.080
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:23.170
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:28.510
I'm feeling nauseous

00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:38.900
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:49.070
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:59.370
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:09.800
Cold finger girl

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.950
Sit Down

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.300
Hey!

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:33.800
Is there a king around here?

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.460
I am King Iidachi.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.090
You see, I have a serious problem right now.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:48.220
I no longer know what I can do about it. It does trouble me so...

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.460
So, you're just gonna talk about your problems

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.570
to some grade-schoolers you never seen before?

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.100
It's pretty rough plotting...

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:52.150
The captain of the Black Sky Dragon Knights,

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:57.290
the Demon Lord's right hand man, General Luci, has fallen in love with my daughter!

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.820
General Luci is ferociously powerful.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:07.340
One swing of a spear from him, and he can cleave a mountain in two!

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:12.090
If you can protect my daughter from General Luci,

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:14.140
I'll declare you fit to be her husband!

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:18.090
So, young lads, will you be my daughter's bodyguards?

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.230
Says him.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:20.090
What should we do?

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.590
I'd rather not be tied down to one girl.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.590
I got Rina-chan, myself!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.760
So those five were absent again today?

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.120
Yes, they were.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:34.430
Itoi Rina from my class has also been absent, and I haven't heard anything from her.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:34.770
Oh?

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:38.680
Well, I doubt it has anything to do with those five.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.780
<i>I hope it doesn't...</i>

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:48.600
Having to fight the right hand man in the first event sure is harsh.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.870
Yeah...

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.540
Do you really have the time to worry?

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:56.970
Why do you think I asked you all to name the girls you liked?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.020
I like Itoi Rina!

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.270
All right! It came off!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:09.240
Allow me to introduce my daughter.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.600
Enter!

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:16.110
It couldn't be...

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.740
The girl from Higashi Nakano...

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.690
This is my daughter, Princess Apparel.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.870
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:42.710
I, the daughter of royal blood, would choose death over falling into the hands of some demon.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.050
Please, good travelers!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.140
Protect...

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:49.480
Shut the hell up!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.770
How could you hit me so suddenly?

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:54.720
What the hell are you doing, Prince Baka-san?

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.420
What? I am the Princess.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.540
Why the hell are <i>you</i> the Princess?

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.160
I considered using the girls you liked as the Princess,

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.290
but I thought I'd surprise you by showing up myself.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:05.470
I see.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:06.530
Yes, we were quite surprised.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:12.080
But didn't it occur to you that we might catch you and beat the crap out of you?

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:13.950
Ah, I suppose...

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:14.420
But...

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:21.510
When I thought I might be able to surprise you...

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:22.930
I didn't really think...

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.340
things through...

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.430
<i>Dude just got out of drama school?</i>

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:29.980
<i>We got a space-case here.</i>

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:33.090
So you see... might you untie these bonds?

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:33.800
Hell no!

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.660
Take us back to Earth, right now!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.600
Stop this damn game!

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:38.990
Sorry, but no can do.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.770
Here comes the condescension!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.540
Don't y'get the situation yer in, bitch?

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.360
Please, consider the situation!

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.330
If I am playing the role of Princess, then someone else

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:48.490
must be the Demon Lord!

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:49.870
What?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:55.500
The Demon Lord is an artificial intelligence that thinks and learns on its own.

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:59.760
By now it is impossible for even I, the creator, to predict its actions.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.760
Furthermore, the game machine and spaceship are located in the Demon Lord's castle.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:07.020
In other words, as long as you do not defeat the Demon Lord...

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:10.050
You ain't never leavin' this planet, buckos!

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:15.190
And you're in the same freakin' boat!

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.200
Figure it out already!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.450
Whatever shall I do?

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:22.760
Die!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.820
For now, let us solve the problem immediately at hand.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:30.250
General Luci will arrive, so we must decide if we'll fight to protect Prince...

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.980
I mean, Princess Apparel.

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:33.620
No way in hell I'm fighting for that jerk!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.400
He deserves a good ass-reaming!

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.180
That would be entertaining, yes.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:42.220
But as he is the creator, I believe he could serve as our adviser for clearing this game.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.880
I see.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.100
So Prince, what should we do?

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:48.310
What are your levels?

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:50.380
Somewhere between 35 and 70.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.600
General Luci's level is 1300.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.220
How're we supposed to win?!

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.370
There's no need to worry.

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:59.980
I've set it up so you don't fight right at the start.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:04.480
In fact, if you show a brave face, he should recognize you as worthy opponents!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.580
It's time.

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:11.700
He comes.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.280
That's General Luci?

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:34.060
Now then... I do hope I have come to hear my desired answer.

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:36.470
No matter how many times you come, you can never have my daughter!

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.180
Where'd he come from?

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:40.710
Hey, buddy... It's important to know when you're not wanted.

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:44.070
Don't go chasin' after some woman who turned you down, dumbass!

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.190
Oh? Who are you peons?

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.610
We are Princess Apparel's bodyguards!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.360
My, what a piece of work we have here.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.450
Leave now, children, before I kill you.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.590
Oh yeah? Just try it...

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:05.320
Next time, I'll aim for you.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.450
Hey, are you sure about this?

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.580
This is odd.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.170
What?!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.850
The artificial intelligence settings for the enemy characters have been modified.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.850
There is only one thing that could do this...

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.750
The Demon Lord?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.490
It's shrewder than I anticipated.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.700
It's far too dangerous for us to continue the game like this.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.030
To the east is a holy shrine.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:32.760
The demons cannot come near it.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.940
You all head there.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.930
What will you do?

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.710
I will think of a way to return to Earth safely.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:40.350
H-Hey...

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.070
Understood.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.670
I will become your wife.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.880
Princess Apparel!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:47.790
He's still here?

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:01.980
Seriously?

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.320
Don't you think this is all just some act?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.220
No. I think this is really happening.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:10.660
This is getting fun...

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:12.980
Since that's what he said under his breath.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.380
Chromatic Squadron!

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:27.040
Color Rangers!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:33.590
Bus Gas Explosion! Bus Gas Explosion! Bus Gas Explosion!

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.330
SURELY the morning moon, I thought, has bathed the hill in light

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.260
But, no; I see it is the snow

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:37.770
That, falling in the night, has made Yoshino white.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.060
Yokota!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:43.820
I put bamboo on a bamboo grove because

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.440
I wanted to put bamboo on a bamboo grove!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.810
The Chief of the Tokyo Special Patent Approval Office

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:50.070
suddenly takes vacation and rejects all applications!

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:53.980
Is everyone okay?

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.510
Yeah, somehow.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:56.710
What is it?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:00.380
Wouldn't now be the time to sing the Color Ranger song?

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.030
This is no time for games.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.750
You must hurry to the shrine.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.920
Sheesh, we know, damn it.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.220
Battle Light!

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.930
While we have the chance, let me tell you about the Demon Lord.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.430
It can convert its own body at will.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.890
It can choose anything from 1 to 15 meters tall.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.410
Its outer appearance can take on a nearly infinite number of variations.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:27.440
In other words, its form may be something no one has ever seen before.

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:29.810
Oh sure, that's <i>real</i> useful!

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.520
Some creator you turned out to be!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.950
A fun game should hold unknown surprises for even its creator.

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:38.280
This has gone way beyond a game!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.240
And wait... You sure you should be communicating like this?

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:49.590
He is currently fervently engaged in studying proper wedding night behavior.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:53.190
After all, other than the Demon Lord, the other AIs are designed only for battle.

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:56.350
It will take quite a lot of time for him to memorize the birds and the...

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.710
Princess. I have a question.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:04.090
Are you a normal?

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.850
No. I am somewhat abnormal.

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.490
Wait a moment.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.740
There are three ways to end this game.

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.670
1. The main character's party is wiped out.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.630
2. Defeat the Demon Lord.

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.620
3. Turn off the game system.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:27.410
We can choose between options 2 and 3.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:30.000
But the difficulty lies in the Demon Lord's Honor Guard,

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.910
which resides in the Demon Lord's castle.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:35.890
You must defeat them to beat the game.

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:39.970
What level do we need to be to beat them?

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:42.640
Don't just be silent!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:48.400
Our one saving grace is that the Demon Lord fears the game ending more than we do,

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:52.150
because that would spell the end of this world, essentially.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:56.080
Hence, it will not allow you to be killed.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.280
Rather, if you are found, it will imprison you with great care,

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.030
and take steps to prolong your lives...

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.520
Princess...

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.170
What kind of toys?

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:09.080
No. We will not be using any toys tonight.

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:14.930
Wait a moment longer.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.540
I will make haste once I have gathered more detailed data.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:18.510
Wait for me at the shrine.

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:21.270
Is that it?

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.250
Can you come? It's your wedding night...

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:26.130
I did intend to defend my chastity to the death, however...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.610
If I am late, please disregard that matter.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.820
It seems like he's got his own problems.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.950
Well, he dug his own grave.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:41.260
Now, Princess... It's time we began!

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:45.210
I shall endeavor to live up to your every desire, without imperfection!

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.150
Well then...

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:08.180
Somehow, I got through that dangerous situation.

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.240
How'd you do that?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:13.050
The world of us adults would take a long time to explain.

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.730
The Role Play Game.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:20.000
The student told to stay behind after class, and the female teacher that totally forgot.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.780
I have obtained a map of the Demon Lord's castle.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:23.890
I will head to where you are immediately!

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:27.440
Color Rangers, let us all return to Earth!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.690
That's...

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.660
The Demon Lord's Honor Guard?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.210
The Demon Lord is taking his great army and heading in your direction!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:38.210
Hurry and take shelter inside the shrine!

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:42.420
Run!

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:44.920
Wait for me!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.840
Has it already given the order to advance?

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.850
Perhaps only General Luci was given the order to standby?

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.430
That would buy it time for more actions...

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.180
Demon Lord, you are quite formidable.

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:05.850
Akagawa!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.630
You're such a pain, you know that?

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.880
Anyway, we're safe for now.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:31.920
Hey, Prince! Where are you now?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.670
I have arrived. I made you wait, didn't I?

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.180
Now, what should we do?

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.690
Breaking through from here would be extremely difficult.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.700
Maybe we could use Red as a decoy and escape?

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:49.130
Or better yet, use Red as a human shield!

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.190
Um...

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.670
Hey. One of them's comin' this way.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:57.770
What the heck is that?

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.220
Prince Baka?!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.390
I will now speak with them!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:21.230
No matter what happens, do not move from this spot!

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:24.090
What is the meaning of this?

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:27.030
The only one who could control all the demons is the Demon Lord.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.110
In other words, he's the Demon Lord!

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.850
Hey, look... The Demon Lord is...

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.950
I thought he couldn't enter?

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:35.760
That's right.

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:38.990
The skeletons of the demon race would be repelled by the shield around this place.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.710
But he's climbing up the stairs!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:41.950
Game over, man!

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:44.280
<i>How? How can he enter?</i>

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.160
That's it!

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.630
Come on, what're we gonna do?

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:52.480
What're we gonna do? We've gotta fight, that's what!

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.770
No, it'll be okay.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.280
If the Demon Lord is able to enter the shrine,

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:00.210
it means he has chosen the skeleton of a normal townsperson.

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:04.320
In other words, the current strength of the Demon Lord is less than even a level 1 mob!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:05.260
But, why?

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.860
I don't want to believe it myself, but that fits my conjecture.

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:17.960
Greetings, I am the Demon Lord.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.410
R-Right...

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:22.230
This is the game system.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.310
I will return you all to Earth.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:31.300
If you do not believe what I am about to say to you, then feel free to stop the game.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:36.390
But, if you believe me, would you please choose not to end this game?

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:40.760
Weren't you ordered to defeat us?

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.210
No.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:45.100
When I was born...

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:53.110
The only memory I had was that I was the Demon Lord.

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:58.870
I didn't know why I was born, nor what I had to do.

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:04.000
I bet he forgot to input the purpose of the game into the Demon Lord...

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:05.950
As I thought.

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:11.610
And so, in order to find my purpose, I sought knowledge.

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:15.890
I read many different books, and soon I comprehended right from wrong.

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:19.390
When I learned of the Demon Lord's job, I suffered quite a shock.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.100
But, the most shocking thing of all...

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:26.700
...was when I discovered the one who could be said to have birthed me

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:29.350
took pleasure in causing others misfortune!

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.860
Maybe I should stop keeping those diaries...

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:35.750
I am grateful to him for creating me.

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:38.740
But I do not wish to become like that person.

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:43.870
I wish to make this planet a paradise for these monsters!

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:48.760
A world where they each move of their own free will, with no strife or battle...

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.850
And so I never forget my conviction,

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.210
I have chosen my outward appearance as the only aspect resembling my parent!

00:17:56.780 --> 00:18:02.480
I want to work hard to make the job of Demon Lord of this planet something to take pride in.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:04.710
Do you believe me?

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:06.770
What'll we do?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.810
This might be another trap...

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.840
This was made by that prince! Of course it's a trap!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:14.610
The song...

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:17.320
The song that was sung to me as a baby...

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.680
...was the Color Ranger song!

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:30.580
Everyone...

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:33.090
We believe you.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:33.930
Yup.

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:35.590
Feel free to keep the game going like this.

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:37.040
Thank you!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.460
Thank you so much!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.400
I'm against this.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:49.340
Let's hear your reason.

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:53.860
This will not achieve the true objective of the game.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:55.860
And the true objective is...?

00:18:56.510 --> 00:19:01.870
To entertain me as I watch your confident, serious faces turn to anguish!

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:05.300
At first, the story proceeds just as planned,

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:07.450
and you slowly get sucked further into the game.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:12.170
When you are hooked, a variety of traps will slowly, gradually, begin to cause you grief.

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:14.830
For example, if you go west about 100km,

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.900
there is a city where swirls all manner of desires, intrigues, and betrayals!

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:20.230
If you go there, you will surely lose your trust in people,

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:22.710
and that childhood innocence of yours will be lost forever!

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:24.920
There's also plenty of items!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:27.120
Powder that lets you go for three days on no sleep without ever tiring!

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:29.140
Incense that makes you feel like new with just a whiff!

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:33.310
To increase your desire for destruction, I've prepared a great number of spells!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.630
If you combine the powers of the five colors,

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:38.390
it turns into a Golden Power and you can unleash incredible might even at level 1!

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:41.150
Oh? And what spell might that be?

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:45.480
You point your fingers at who you want to beat, and all shout "Golden Hammer!"

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:48.650
Then, the golden fist of justice will thrust...

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:52.510
Golden Hammer!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:16.320
The flame of justice, budding in your young hearts...

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.600
We'll come back to play.

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:16.200
Guess we'll have to stay alive for ya.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.450
Yeah. Keep playing the game forever.

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:22.750
If you don't do anything, it will go out.

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:22.400
Although it's turned into a nation building simulation.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.110
Well, take care, Demon Lord!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:29.520
Just as the sun's rays shine down upon the Earth,

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:25.810
I will!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:35.880
you need that courage, that love!

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:43.750
It's times like this you must remember!

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:50.860
Shout out the names of the five colors!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:50.350
Everyone! Thank you for everything!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:51.820
Blue!

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:52.270
Black!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:53.290
Yellow!

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:54.230
White!

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:57.090
Red Charge!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:03.860
Call forth your soul of justice!

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:03.190
Sure is nice he didn't take after his dad.

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.740
Yeah. He's a good guy.

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:07.440
Oh! Color Rangers!

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.620
Hey, Driver! How long till Earth did you say?

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:10.670
Go! Color Rangers!

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:10.370
Yeah, yeah...

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.150
About three hours through the Galactic Wormhole route.

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:13.760
Fight! Color Rangers!

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:17.280
It'll take about 11.6 billion years using normal routes, however...

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:17.280
The Chromatic Squadron, Color Rangers!

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:19.540
Take the wormhole route.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:20.590
Oh! Color Rangers!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.960
The tolls'll be expensive.

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:23.820
Go! Color Rangers!

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:22.880
Pay 'em yourself!

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:26.910
Fight! Color Rangers!

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:32.420
The Chromatic Squadron, Color Rangers!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:31.010
My heart's really feelin' it!

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:39.980
Good morning, Tachibana-sensei!

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:41.950
Good morning.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:45.720
The five safely returned to the Earth.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:48.210
Wassup?

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:52.480
But, unfortunately, they did not realize:

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.900
Until the game ended,

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:59.230
they would warp back to the planet Calvary whenever they assembled in the classroom together.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:57.390
They really just disappeared!

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:02.840
Maybe it really would be for the best if I got rid of that prince...

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:11.070
When the five once again warped to the planet Calvary,

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:13.980
what awaited them was the prince,

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:16.770
who had taken over the world as the Great Demon Lord!

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.410
Are you ready?

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:37.920
Do not fear 'The Now' searching for something that can't be seen across this infinite distance

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:52.140
Under the hundred million glittering lights, I found you searching for your dream

00:22:52.140 --> 00:23:00.900
An infinite world filled with glass shards

00:23:02.070 --> 00:23:12.960
Growing up I felt I knew many meaningless things

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:20.420
Shining like a jewel, you soar in the sky, no past, no future

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:25.760
The answer is beyond the sky

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:36.270
Do not fear 'The Dream', in a distant
place where truth and lies are unseen

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:52.000
Under the hundred million glittering lights, flowers sway in the wind

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:58.920
Princess Saki of the Makbak Kingdom

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:00.210
is coming to Earth, it seems.

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.300
Please tell me she hasn't entered mating season...

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:08.720
The races chosen by that queen always die out in a few generations, without fail.

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:12.370
Even if this world is destroyed, I don't care as long as I can be with her!

00:24:12.370 --> 00:24:15.660
Why'd it have to turn out like this?!

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:18.150
Next time: You're my darling!

00:24:18.150 --> 00:24:20.350
Our meeting surely must be fate!
